### Create group discussion
POST{{host}}/discussions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{customer_token}}

{
  "groupId": "4e07052f-4bd0-4f2d-ac80-53d776c9e49b",
  "title": "Lets get the savings started2",
  "body": "We really need to start saving hard guys. It is in the beginning of the year and we need to be sure of what to do with our lives"
}

### Get group discussions
GET{{host}}/discussions/4e07052f-4bd0-4f2d-ac80-53d776c9e49b
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{customer_token}}

### Get group discussions by id
GET{{host}}/discussions/4e07052f-4bd0-4f2d-ac80-53d776c9e49b/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{customer_token}}

### Create group discussion comment
POST{{host}}/discussions/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{customer_token}}

{
  "groupId": "4e07052f-4bd0-4f2d-ac80-53d776c9e49b",
  "comment": "first to comment"
}

